# The images built with the repository root as their context are the vault exporter's
# (infra/images/vault-exporter), the deposit indexer's (infra/images/deposit-indexer),
# the withdrawal payer's (infra/images/withdrawal-payer), the withdrawal signer's
# (infra/images/withdrawal-signer) and kms-dev's (infra/images/kms-dev): their sources
# go in, nothing else. Chain data, keys
# and passwords in .devnet, contract builds and libraries never reach a build.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/vault-exporter
!cmd/deposit-indexer
!cmd/withdrawal-payer
!cmd/withdrawal-signer
!cmd/kms-dev
!internal/vaultwatch
!internal/ledger
!internal/deposits
!internal/suspense
!internal/withdrawals
!internal/signer
!internal/kmsdev
!internal/awscreds
